# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Pages reads this file at deploy time and applies it to matching paths. It is a
# Pages/Netlify convention — GitHub Pages ignores it entirely and offers no way to set
# headers, which is one reason to prefer Pages as the host.
#
# The CSP is only this tight because no inline script survives in the site: the popup
# buttons carry their arguments in data-* attributes and are dispatched by one delegated
# listener in app.js. Adding an onclick="" anywhere would force 'unsafe-inline' back into
# script-src and give most of this away, so don't.
#
# Every host below has to be here for a reason:
#   cdnjs.cloudflare.com   Leaflet, pinned by SRI in index.html
#   *.workers.dev          the isochrone proxy in worker/ — must match DEFAULT_API_BASE
#                          in app.js, so change both together
#   server.arcgisonline.com  Esri basemap and label tiles
#   static.cloudflareinsights.com  the Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon script
#   cloudflareinsights.com   where that beacon POSTs its page views (connect-src) —
#                          both hosts pair with the <script> tag at the foot of
#                          index.html and privacy.html, so change them together
#
# style-src keeps 'unsafe-inline' because markers, legend swatches and popups set colours
# through style="" attributes. That is a much smaller concession than script-src would be:
# it cannot execute anything.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com; img-src 'self' data: https://server.arcgisonline.com; connect-src 'self' https://moovin-api.cameron-02e.workers.dev https://cloudflareinsights.com; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
